- Oh my god I love you.

00:00:31.660 --> 00:00:32.560
Meet Norman Leary.

00:00:32.560 --> 00:00:34.288
- How are you?
- Oh I'm stoked.

00:00:34.288 --> 00:00:36.330
- Ow.
(laughing)

00:00:36.330 --> 00:00:37.163
- I'm so strong.

00:00:37.163 --> 00:00:39.140
